    "name": "The Third Shift",
    "steam_appid": 2079480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A museum in need of security...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A person in need of money...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>An odd occurrence.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Third Shift is a Game Boy styled horror game that combines first, second, and third person perspectives. Watch your stamina and sustain your mental health as you patrol the halls and complete your third shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079480/extras/c064f10cbf4cfff12d6ba91afa586efb.avif?t=1753117312\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Museum to Secure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're the newly-hired night shift security guard at the Roanoke Museum of History and Wonder when things don't go as planned. Patrol through a variety of exhibits including the Human Body exhibit, the Terrors of the Deep, the Mystery of Roanoke exhibit and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079480/extras/9d9d898854368300ab53cd42cd44aad8.avif?t=1753117312\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange happenings are afoot on Roanoke island. As you learn more about the freak occurrences happening all around you, you'll uncover mysteries surrounding the museum and the nearby community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embrace the History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Third Shift was created as an homage to the Game Boy aesthetic. Wander through the halls, experience the puzzling exhibits, and run for your life in an 8-bit inspired style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Move: Arrow Keys or WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Interact (A Button): Space or Z\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Sprint (B Button): B or X</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Exit: Esc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Menu: M</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Inventory: I</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: Limited Gamepad Support is available.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A museum in need of security...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A person in need of money...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>An odd occurrence.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Third Shift is a Game Boy styled horror game that combines first, second, and third person perspectives. Watch your stamina and sustain your mental health as you patrol the halls and complete your third shift.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079480/extras/c064f10cbf4cfff12d6ba91afa586efb.avif?t=1753117312\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A Museum to Secure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're the newly-hired night shift security guard at the Roanoke Museum of History and Wonder when things don't go as planned. Patrol through a variety of exhibits including the Human Body exhibit, the Terrors of the Deep, the Mystery of Roanoke exhibit and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2079480/extras/9d9d898854368300ab53cd42cd44aad8.avif?t=1753117312\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unravel the Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Strange happenings are afoot on Roanoke island. As you learn more about the freak occurrences happening all around you, you'll uncover mysteries surrounding the museum and the nearby community.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Embrace the History</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Third Shift was created as an homage to the Game Boy aesthetic. Wander through the halls, experience the puzzling exhibits, and run for your life in an 8-bit inspired style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u00a0Controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Move: Arrow Keys or WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Interact (A Button): Space or Z\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Sprint (B Button): B or X</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Exit: Esc</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Menu: M</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0Inventory: I</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: Limited Gamepad Support is available.</p>",
    "short_description": "A Game Boy styled horror game that combines first, second, and third person perspectives. As the newest employee at the Roanoke Museum of History and Wonder, beware of odd occurrences as you patrol the halls and complete your third shift.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe pixel art animation is fantastic and there are lots of strange exhibits to discover as you explore the creepy old museum, some of which are far from friendly! You\u2019ll need your wits about you to stay safe while dealing with the various emergencies that crop up. Highly recommended.\u201d<br>Alpha Beta Gamer<br>",
